  "title": "South African Pumpkin Soup with Banana and Curry",
  "description": "This dairy-free soup is smooth and delicious. It&#39;s made with pumpkin, banana, carrot, coconut milk, curry, and lots of other spices. Enjoy during the cold winter months.",
